: 함초롬바탕\">근로기간 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2015. 3. 2(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) ~ 6.19(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">금</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><font color=\"#ff007f\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">근로장학생 선발자 통보방법 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">대상자에게 개인별 문자발송 예정(27일 14시 예정)</span></font></strong></p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">미선발된 학생은 별도 연락하지 않습니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">추후 미선발된 부서가 있을 경우 재 공지 하겠습니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SP